## Minimal cohort adaptations

The actual new4 configuration is the source baseline. These five values select original63:

| Field | Actual new4 baseline | Original63 value |
|---|---|---|
| batch | new4 | existing63 |
| declared_groups | 4 | 63 |
| declared_controls | 58 | 1249 |
| preparation_review | New4 review 35A3A1E9 | Full regression63 review pin 9362D149 above |
| selected_group_names | Four newly integrated groups | All 63 names from the regression review, in their unchanged original order |

The template contains the complete ordered list. A read-only comparison established equality with both the original V34 grant's groups and the accepted original63 helper's GROUPS literal. The list is unique and disjoint from new4. Its 1,249 declarations are counted from the same 117-group / 2,013-declaration matrix, with all 576 dependency rows retained.

Use **existing63** in constructor/config/helper batch identity and control/proof directory prefixes. Use **regression63** in the prepared directory and preparation-review.batch. This distinction is intentional. Constructor lines 35-38 accept existing63 and 63/1249; lines 66-73 require the exact original order. The helper checks the existing63 launch identity at lines 167-175.

## Separate future Root issuance

The inert template changes 11 top-level values from the actual new4 configuration: status, execution_authorized, the five cohort fields, root_review, issued_utc, fresh_memory_observation and root_resource_ownership. Every other top-level value is retained. In the ownership object only phase, observed_free_kib, observed_utc, native_candidates and allowed_groups change.

| Item | Inert template | Requirement for a separately issued configuration |
|---|---|---|
| status | unissued_specific_v38_existing63_buildquery_template | The existing exact constructor status root_reviewed_specific_v38_buildquery_preparation |
| execution_authorized | false | A distinct actual Root issuance; the template is not authorization |
| root_review | Explicit source-only narrative | Root's original63-specific review and retained strict scope |
| issued_utc | null | Actual fresh issuance time |
| fresh_memory_observation | Actual observation fields null; threshold/classifier retained | Fresh complete classifier and memory observation, including no competing native candidates |
| root_resource_ownership | Observation fields null; original63 phase and all 63 allowed groups | Actual separate Root serial resource ownership and fresh observations |
| actual_metadata_count | null | Must remain null throughout BuildQuery issuance; derive only from later independent original63 metadata |
| runtime_authority / qualification | false / false | Remain false; RuntimeOnly requires a separate later grant |

The bound constructor hash 5ACED5A1, head, common matrix, catalog acceptance 911DCC32 and independent emitted peer B69569A2 remain unchanged. Keep preserved_previous_configuration and historical_progress_rebinding as original history. Do not replace historical paths merely because equivalent bytes exist in regression63.

