## Provenance conclusion: retain all 53 entries

No additional grant provenance key is required for the original63 helper. Preserve the complete grant_provenance_updates object from new4, including key order and every pin. The canonical object digest, using sorted-key compact JSON plus one LF, is:

E1FECB03FD6C4F240958387323840A9E3F0CE28831D24730C57A6116C31A1EAB

The constructor verifies all supplied pins and copies all non-reserved provenance entries at lines 77 and 107-125. It does not mandate a new helper-specific key or a 53-key count; 53 is the exact minimal retained set from the accepted current configuration.

The accepted helper at lines 156-164 requires the original specific configuration and **v38_execution_bound_source_review = Root receipt 20ECFC7C**, which must identify the exact constructor 5ACED5A1 and positive auditor 6BCBE327. Do not replace that review with helper acceptance 8933C506: the receipts have different roles and schemas. Retain 8933C506 as the separate helper source-acceptance evidence in this plan and the later helper review. No helper-specific addition to the grant is necessary.

The helper remains unresolved. Its 17 actual bindings and separate helper/audit-input issuance can follow only the original63 terminal BuildQuery and independent metadata observations. New4's observed counts and results do not transfer to this cohort.

## Strict gates retained

Keep the original driver 1DD3A9D27FA7B54F9383F325792A9E5259C66C32FA6C601F21216B4DBB483601 and classifier 3413A2A50B4D4C3BFF8709E4EE08C76BE449AAB1EDCB1E0C5C167DC7A804E301. The regression63 metadata auditor remains 17,704 bytes / 5B94D3BD4B6CA0E1B969394926A7F907485717FF25B75BA06D1D67D68A232682.

The unchanged controls include the 64-group cap; 300-second initial grant freshness; at least 16 GiB free; one serial native owner; fresh private caches; 1,320-second compile, 30-second metadata, 120-second runtime-owner, 10-second settle and 1,800-second owned-outer deadlines; exact whole-input and artifact seals; complete original process-instance evidence; and strict metadata/empty-stderr rules. The BuildQuery grant's execution-binding slots for build results, metadata, artifacts and actual counts remain null; historical provenance stays retained. Later RuntimeOnly remains a distinct phase.

Only inert data and this plan were created in the SDK worktree. No constructor, helper, candidate prefix, auditor or native workload ran; no configuration was issued; Main, its index and all accepted source/catalog files were untouched.
